## Supabase project (see PLANNING.md §4) — client-side, safe to expose in the SPA bundle.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

## Server-only — Edge Functions / drizzle-kit migrations / ops scripts
## (packages/db/scripts), never shipped to the client. Edge Functions get
## these injected automatically by the Supabase runtime; ops scripts need
## them set locally (SUPABASE_URL can mirror VITE_SUPABASE_URL's value).
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_DB_URL=

## daily-summary Edge Function only — not auto-injected, must be set via
## `supabase secrets set` (prod) / this file (local `supabase start`).
## Groq (console.groq.com) — free tier, no billing required for this feature's volume.
GROQ_API_KEY=
